 "observations": [
  "The lines stand on the wrapper as on the title page (frame 007): the faculty in two underlined lines at the top right, then «No. 2» in Latin type, the title, the author, a short rule, the line on the editors, the two editors in two columns (Mušarrafa on the right, Aḥmad on the left, «و» between them), a double rule and the printer with the year. The wrapper prints أحمد with the hamza, the title page احمد without it."
 ],
 "copy_matter": [
  "The wrapper is mounted on the green cloth binding of Columbia University Libraries; the binding and its spine are copy matter, not part of the edition."
